note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Alias-violation control for the CURRENT language (OMEGESE 9.4): the arrays of one call must be
note distinct names, so passing one array as both an edit and a view argument is refused (error 19).
fn mix a edit uchar 4 b view uchar 4 to void
put a 0 get b 0
end
fn main to int
x = new uchar 4 0
mix x x
ret 0
end
